  "2026-08-11T16:34:42.747Z","harness:codex","Exact-head preflight remediation: the first pushed run failed only the unweakened 3,400-line source ceiling because the new assurance producer made the generated error catalog 3,401 implementation lines. TDD first exposed an incorrect fixture expectation; the generator now deterministically keeps string arrays up to 100 columns on one line, shrinking the generated catalog by eight implementation lines. Focused 15 tests, catalog freshness, and the full static-quality gate now pass with all violations empty and 100% source/export/member docstrings."
